2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Graph\055based\040analysis\040of\040brain\040connectivity\040in\040schizophrenia\056)
/Author (Elzbieta\040Olejarczyk\054\040Wojciech\040Jernajczyk)
/Subject (The\040present\040study\040evaluated\040brain\040connectivity\040using\040electroencephalography\040\050EEG\051\040data\040from\04014\040patients\040with\040schizophrenia\040and\04014\040healthy\040controls\056\040Phase\055Locking\040Value\040\050PLV\051\054\040Phase\055Lag\040Index\040\050PLI\051\040and\040Directed\040Transfer\040Function\040\050DTF\051\040were\040calculated\040for\040the\040original\040EEG\040data\040and\040following\040current\040source\040density\040\050CSD\051\040transformation\054\040re\055referencing\040using\040the\040average\040reference\040electrode\040\050AVERAGE\051\040and\040reference\040electrode\040standardization\040techniques\040\050REST\051\056\040The\040statistical\040analysis\040of\040adjacency\040matrices\040was\040carried\040out\040using\040indices\040based\040on\040graph\040theory\056\040Both\040CSD\040and\040REST\040reduced\040the\040influence\040of\040volume\040conducted\040currents\056\040The\040largest\040group\040differences\040in\040connectivity\040were\040observed\040for\040the\040alpha\040band\056\040Schizophrenic\040patients\040showed\040reduced\040connectivity\040strength\054\040as\040well\040as\040a\040lower\040clustering\040coefficient\040and\040shorter\040characteristic\040path\040length\040for\040both\040measures\040of\040phase\040synchronization\040following\040CSD\040transformation\040or\040REST\040re\055referencing\056\040Reduced\040synchronization\040was\040accompanied\040by\040increased\040directional\040flow\040from\040the\040occipital\040region\040for\040the\040alpha\040band\056\040Following\040the\040REST\040re\055referencing\054\040the\040sources\040of\040alpha\040activity\040were\040located\040at\040parietal\040rather\040than\040occipital\040derivations\056\040The\040results\040of\040PLV\040and\040DTF\040demonstrated\040group\040differences\040in\040fronto\055posterior\040asymmetry\040following\040CSD\040transformation\054\040while\040for\040PLI\040the\040differences\040were\040significant\040only\040using\040REST\056\040The\040only\040analysis\040that\040identified\040group\040differences\040in\040inter\055hemispheric\040asymmetry\040was\040DTF\040calculated\040for\040REST\056\040Our\040results\040suggest\040that\040a\040comparison\040of\040different\040connectivity\040measures\040using\040graph\055based\040indices\040for\040each\040frequency\040band\054\040separately\054\040may\040be\040a\040useful\040tool\040in\040the\040study\040of\040disconnectivity\040disorders\040such\040as\040schizophrenia\056)
/Keywords (30\040Nov\0402017\054\040PLOS\040ONE\054\040Polish\040Academy\040of\040Sciences)
>>
